[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0010","text":"一、二、三、四\n一、二、三、四"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0020","text":"……──喂！各位——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0030","text":"！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0040","text":"制作人……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0050","text":"……\n……好好吃……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0060","text":"慰问品\n真的非常感谢，制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0070","text":"哪里，能让你们这么开心我就心满意足了\n……之后还要继续练习吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0080","text":"好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0090","text":"……大家，能不能也让我帮上点忙？\n今天的自主练习也好，今后也好，我想尽可能……出一份力"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0100","text":"……毕竟，我也是\nillumination STARS的第一个粉丝嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0110","text":"让我和大家一起\n努力吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0120","text":"真是的……！　想拜托“一起努力”的\n明明是我们这边……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0130","text":" 太狡猾了，制作人……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0140","text":"……嘿嘿。不过，谢谢你\n有制作人在的话，就是如虎添翼呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0150","text":"只要有制作人看着我们，我们——一定能更加闪耀……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0160","text":" 那就这么约定了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0170","text":"是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0180","text":"……就这么决定了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0190","text":"好的\n请多关照，制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_04_0200","text":"“如果红色的天空是驻足的时间\n　那么蓝色的天空——”"}]
